<title>ISRAEL: Two Israeli soldiers killed in Gaza - radio.</title>
<headline>Two Israeli soldiers killed in Gaza - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Israeli soldiers were killed in clashes with Palestinians, including police, in the Gaza Strip on Thursday, Israel Radio said.</p>
<p>It said the two were killed when hundreds of Palestinians, including dozens of policemen, charged an army post near the Netzarim Jewish settlement.</p>
</text>
